    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B05a scope (agents & MCP admin)","items":["Part of B05-agent-workflow split (140 routes/20 controllers reconciled). Modules: agent (11/1), agent-admin (25/2), agent-promotion (4/2), agent-trajectory (3/1), agentic-admin (1/1), mcp-admin (5/1).","Agent runtime: /agents. Agent admin: /admin/agents, /admin/agent-assignments, /admin/agent-promotions (incl. promote-to-system). Observability/admin: /admin/agent-trajectory sessions/steps, /admin/agentic. MCP admin: /admin/mcp-servers CRUD.","Harness-admin is split into B05b; workflow modules into B05c."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Agent runtime/admin routes: agent/assignment/promotion DTOs -> agent config/assignment/promotion records (verify exact route contracts per controller).","Agent trajectory: GET sessions and GET sessions/:sessionId/steps -> grouped session stats and ordered step records (PHI-safe/admin-scoped; cross-tenant/nonexistent handling per controller behavior).","MCP server admin: POST/PATCH/DELETE /admin/mcp-servers -> MCP server registry records (optimistic concurrency/tenant/SYSTEM rules noted in catalog). Verify authrefs/secret handling."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified in local tree.","Downstreams: agent/MCP/trajectory data store (Postgres/Prisma). Agent runtime may call model/tool/MCP execution dependencies (deployment-specific) — summarized as runtime deps.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (49 routes across 8 controllers); agentic-admin service naming not separately verified; reconcile exact route/DTO contracts and MCP secret/authref handling with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
